  unitName: Bolt Sibyl Zele
  unitId: 40244
  unitNumber: 398
  description: The third youngest of the Six Sibyl Sisters. During the second half
    of the war between the gods and the humans, she fought against the Fresh Blood
    Sisters. As former coordinator of their group she tried convincing them to stop
    fighting. However, as Paula's cruel acts toward humans grew in intensity, she
    had no choice but to use force to end her appalling behavior. She grew powerful
    with determination, unleashing an unforgiving torrent of lightning on her sister.
  summonDesc: I will always love my sisters.<br>You knew this when you summoned<br>me,
    didn't you Summoner?
  fusionDesc: My older sister used to tell<br>me that I think too much.<br>Do you
    know what she meant?
  evoDesc: I didn't have enough power before.<br>I wonder if now I might have <br>what
    it takes to stop her.
  element: 4
  rarity: 4
